\frac{f(x+\Delta x)-f(x)}{\Delta x}
=\frac{1/(x+\Delta x)-1/x}{\Delta x}
=\frac{-\Delta x}{x(x+\Delta x)\Delta x}
=-\frac1{x(x+\Delta x)}
\longrightarrow-\frac1{x^2}.

